From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tim2tox-bootstrap <bootstrap@local>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] NativeLibraryManager: accept an already-decoded
 friend_id_array in the DeleteFriend callback

The DeleteFriend global callback did `json.decode(dataFromNativeMap[
"friend_id_array"])`, but tim2tox hands the array over already decoded
(a List), so the dispatch threw `type 'List<dynamic>' is not a subtype of
type 'String'` (seen on every friend deletion on the Windows real-UI VM;
platform-independent) and the friendship listener never got
onFriendListDeleted. Accept a List directly, decode a non-empty JSON
string, and treat an absent payload as an empty list.
---
 lib/native_im/bindings/native_library_manager.dart | 19 +++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lib/native_im/bindings/native_library_manager.dart b/lib/native_im/bindings/native_library_manager.dart
--- a/lib/native_im/bindings/native_library_manager.dart
+++ b/lib/native_im/bindings/native_library_manager.dart
@@ -1019,11 +1019,20 @@
       }
 
         break;
-      case GlobalCallbackType.DeleteFriend: {
-        final friendIDList = json.decode(dataFromNativeMap["friend_id_array"]);
-
-        _friendshipListener?.onFriendListDeleted(friendIDList.whereType<String>().toList());
-      }
+      case GlobalCallbackType.DeleteFriend: {
+        // tim2tox delivers `friend_id_array` already decoded (a List), not a
+        // JSON string; json.decode on it threw "List<dynamic> is not a subtype
+        // of String" and the deletion never reached the friendship listener.
+        // Accept both shapes; an absent/empty payload is an empty list.
+        final rawFriendIds = dataFromNativeMap["friend_id_array"];
+        final List<dynamic> friendIDList = rawFriendIds is List
+            ? rawFriendIds
+            : (rawFriendIds is String && rawFriendIds.isNotEmpty
+                ? (json.decode(rawFriendIds) as List<dynamic>)
+                : const <dynamic>[]);
+
+        _friendshipListener?.onFriendListDeleted(friendIDList.whereType<String>().toList());
+      }
 
         break;
       case GlobalCallbackType.UpdateFriendProfile: {
